<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; Provisional machine alignment by Codex, independent Tibetan-first proposal. The cessation predicate 'gags has no separate exponent in this row's English and is nulled; the preceding las and concessive kyang are omitted. The English even after a very long time does not supply a word meaning ceased. Initial rtog par byed → invented and de'i phyir → This then is why are phrase mappings at depth 3. brgyud → continues on is a contextual continuation verb, while brgyud pa → indirectly is the later lexical construction; via a medium is an unwrapped explanatory expansion. The final shes par bya'o is recast in the applies formulation without a secure lexical atom and is omitted, as are supplied idea and positions expressed. Repeated mental seed, consequence, deed, say and karma positions are resolved in explicit English order. C16:801 agrees in ACIP/Wylie/English; ILL:1881 shares the passage only through 'dod pa'o and ILL:1882 carries the closing sentence with different English. No ingestion or publication independence is inferred.</div>
